# Monthly mortgage update

When updating mortgage data:

1. Append one object to `entries`: `{ "date": "YYYY-MM-DD", "balance": <number> }`.
2. Keep entries sorted by date (or sort on save).
3. Optionally adjust `forecastMonthlyReduction` or set `forecastMode` to `"auto"` / `"manual"`.
4. Run `npm run validate` before commit.

Do not store secrets in this repo; balance data is public.
